EiH71rUWivVlFor1Y\"/><figcaption>吳嘉儀去年7月在颱風「韋帕」襲港掛十號風球下，於九龍城街市直播。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"堅守崗位。（IG@ah7ng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260728/1158815080939393024673852.jpeg/Cx1lJ2y0SrCxj7NRnDN9zZliGz8SDuIO4aw9KOGsPSg\"/><figcaption>堅守崗位。（IG@ah7ng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"堅守崗位。（IG@ah7ng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260728/1158815078011637760261378.jpeg/DVMT0oouE_rCD4PrRxy5Sg7-mjjrkrolyaa6o8mmuqM\"/><figcaption>堅守崗位。（IG@ah7ng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"浸溫泉。（IG@ah7ng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260715/1154119898918817792043768.jpeg/1R5cS8qON1M5eHevGuxggwOKinr0ogi3FjvU9xY71Pc\"/><figcaption>浸溫泉。（IG@ah7ng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"畫面香艷。（IG@ah7ng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260715/1154119896586653696543027.jpeg/l3paeuENFuX7d6Yl9qD7tjfYEye9bsunSuUCdUrlAnU\"/><figcaption>畫面香艷。（IG@ah7ng）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:15:25.543242+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2031,"images":32,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:00:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:50:15.035898+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T04:08:57.941073+00:00","content_hash":"50b677b942f416940a6c97783c10e6b33ca49783fe55f195d1976be4fd631d85","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}